<%- include('../partials/header', { title: 'Community Guidelines | K-Sync Malaysia' }) %>

<div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 py-10 sm:py-14 min-w-0 max-w-full">
    <!-- Breadcrumb & Top Badge -->
    <div class="mb-8">
        <a href="/" class="inline-flex items-center text-xs font-bold text-slate-500 hover:text-pink-600 mb-3 transition-colors">
            <i class="fas fa-arrow-left me-1.5"></i> Back to K-Sync Malaysia
        </a>
        <div class="flex items-center gap-2 mb-2">
            <span class="px-3 py-1 rounded-full text-xs font-extrabold bg-pink-100 text-pink-700 uppercase tracking-wider">
                <i class="fas fa-heart me-1"></i> Fan Safety & Integrity
            </span>
            <span class="text-xs text-slate-400">Effective Date: October 2026</span>
        </div>
        <h1 class="text-3xl sm:text-4xl font-black text-slate-900 tracking-tight">
            K-Sync Malaysia Community Guidelines
        </h1>
        <p class="text-slate-600 text-sm sm:text-base mt-2 leading-relaxed">
            K-Sync Malaysia is dedicated to maintaining a safe, transparent, and vibrant ecosystem for Malaysian K-Pop fans, concert-goers, fanclubs, cafe project organizers, and event promoters. These guidelines define our standard of conduct across the platform.
        </p>
    </div>

    <!-- Main Content Articles -->
    <div class="space-y-8 text-slate-700 text-sm sm:text-base leading-relaxed">
        
        <!-- Section 1: The Malaysian K-Pop Fan Spirit -->
        <section class="bg-white rounded-3xl p-6 sm:p-8 border border-slate-200/90 shadow-xs space-y-4">
            <div class="flex items-center gap-3">
                <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-2xl bg-pink-50 text-pink-600 flex items-center justify-center font-black text-base shrink-0">
                    1
                </div>
                <h2 class="text-lg sm:text-xl font-extrabold text-slate-900">
                    The K-Sync Fan Spirit: Respect & Inclusion
                </h2>
            </div>
            <p>
                K-Pop fandom culture in Malaysia thrives on cross-fandom camaraderie and shared passion for music, performance, and community. We welcome fans of all generations, groups, and soloists.
            </p>
            <ul class="list-disc list-inside space-y-2 text-slate-600 text-xs sm:text-sm pl-2">
                <li><strong class="text-slate-900">Zero Tolerance for Fanwars & Cyberbullying:</strong> Disparaging other artists, fandoms, individual fans, or organizers is strictly prohibited on event comments, reviews, or community hubs.</li>
                <li><strong class="text-slate-900">Constructive Feedback:</strong> Honest feedback regarding concert acoustic quality, queue management, or venue accessibility is welcomed when expressed respectfully.</li>
                <li><strong class="text-slate-900">Safe In-Person Spaces:</strong> At physical venues (Axiata Arena, Stadium Bukit Jalil, Zepp KL, Mega Star Arena), treat fellow fans, venue security, and public transit staff (RapidKL LRT/MRT) with courtesy.</li>
            </ul>
        </section>

        <!-- Section 2: Anti-Scalping & Ticket Fraud Policy -->
        <section class="bg-white rounded-3xl p-6 sm:p-8 border border-slate-200/90 shadow-xs space-y-4">
            <div class="flex items-center gap-3">
                <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-2xl bg-rose-50 text-rose-600 flex items-center justify-center font-black text-base shrink-0">
                    2
                </div>
                <h2 class="text-lg sm:text-xl font-extrabold text-slate-900">
                    Anti-Scalper & Anti-Scam Protection
                </h2>
            </div>
            <p>
                Ticket scams and predatory markups damage fan communities. K-Sync actively defends fans against fraudulent ticket resellers and secondary market price-gouging.
            </p>
            <div class="p-4 rounded-2xl bg-rose-50/70 border border-rose-200/60 text-xs sm:text-sm text-rose-900 space-y-2">
                <div class="font-bold flex items-center gap-1.5 text-rose-800">
                    <i class="fas fa-shield-halved"></i> Strict Ticketing Rules:
                </div>
                <ul class="list-disc list-inside space-y-1.5 text-rose-800/90">
                    <li><strong class="text-rose-950">Official Links Only:</strong> Arena concerts must link directly to legitimate licensed ticketing platforms (e.g., GoLive Asia, BookMyShow Malaysia, Ticket2U). Unofficial third-party re-sale broker links will be auto-flagged.</li>
                    <li><strong class="text-rose-950">No Markup Sales:</strong> Posting tickets above original face value (+ mandatory merchant processing fees) is prohibited across all K-Sync channels.</li>
                    <li><strong class="text-rose-950">Scam Reporting:</strong> Any user can submit an instant Scam/Fraud Report with proof of fake ticketing, impersonation, or unfulfilled merchandise. Reports trigger an urgent review and listing freeze.</li>
                </ul>
            </div>
        </section>

        <!-- Section 3: Fanclub Cupsleeve & Birthday Gatherings -->
        <section class="bg-white rounded-3xl p-6 sm:p-8 border border-slate-200/90 shadow-xs space-y-4">
            <div class="flex items-center gap-3">
                <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-2xl bg-purple-50 text-purple-600 flex items-center justify-center font-black text-base shrink-0">
                    3
                </div>
                <h2 class="text-lg sm:text-xl font-extrabold text-slate-900">
                    Fanclub Projects, Cupsleeve Cafes & Gatherings
                </h2>
            </div>
            <p>
                Community projects organized by Malaysian fanbases (e.g., CARAT MY, ARMY MY, STAY MY, MOA MY) are a core pillar of K-Sync. To protect fans and cafe partners:
            </p>
            <ul class="list-disc list-inside space-y-2 text-slate-600 text-xs sm:text-sm pl-2">
                <li><strong class="text-slate-900">Confirmed Cafe Venues:</strong> Organizers must obtain explicit permission from the host cafe/venue before publishing. Location, operating hours, and minimum drink order requirements must be stated clearly.</li>
                <li><strong class="text-slate-900">Non-Profit Fan Merchandise:</strong> Fan-made photocards, cupsleeves, and stickers distributed as perks must adhere to non-profit community project standards. Unauthorized commercial reproduction of official copyrighted merchandise is prohibited.</li>
                <li><strong class="text-slate-900">Accurate RSVP & Tier Disclosures:</strong> Tier perk packages (Special Tier vs Normal Tier) must transparently list exact inclusions and distribution times to prevent crowd chaos.</li>
            </ul>
        </section>

        <!-- Section 4: Random Play Dance (RPD) & Public Flash Mobs -->
        <section class="bg-white rounded-3xl p-6 sm:p-8 border border-slate-200/90 shadow-xs space-y-4">
            <div class="flex items-center gap-3">
                <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-2xl bg-indigo-50 text-indigo-600 flex items-center justify-center font-black text-base shrink-0">
                    4
                </div>
                <h2 class="text-lg sm:text-xl font-extrabold text-slate-900">
                    Random Play Dance (RPD) & Public Assemblies
                </h2>
            </div>
            <p>
                Public street dances and dance cover showcases in areas like Bukit Bintang, Pavilion KL, Lalaport BBCC, or Central Market bring fans together.
            </p>
            <ul class="list-disc list-inside space-y-2 text-slate-600 text-xs sm:text-sm pl-2">
                <li><strong class="text-slate-900">Public Space Courtesy:</strong> Hosts must ensure sound levels comply with local council regulations (DBKL / MBPJ) and do not obstruct pedestrian corridors or emergency exits.</li>
                <li><strong class="text-slate-900">Safety & Hydration:</strong> Due to Malaysian tropical weather, organizers must advise participants on hydration, sun protection, and crowd safety.</li>
                <li><strong class="text-slate-900">Free Public Participation:</strong> Standard community RPD events must remain free and open for any fan to join and dance.</li>
            </ul>
        </section>

        <!-- Section 5: Enforcement & Account Sanctions -->
        <section class="bg-white rounded-3xl p-6 sm:p-8 border border-slate-200/90 shadow-xs space-y-4">
            <div class="flex items-center gap-3">
                <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-2xl bg-slate-100 text-slate-800 flex items-center justify-center font-black text-base shrink-0">
                    5
                </div>
                <h2 class="text-lg sm:text-xl font-extrabold text-slate-900">
                    Enforcement, Warnings & Account Sanctions
                </h2>
            </div>
            <p>
                Violations of these guidelines are handled through a tiered escalation model:
            </p>
            <div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-3 gap-3 pt-2">
                <div class="p-4 rounded-2xl bg-slate-50 border border-slate-200 text-center">
                    <div class="text-xs font-bold text-amber-600 uppercase tracking-wider mb-1">Tier 1: Notice</div>
                    <div class="text-xs text-slate-600">Event detail correction request or minor content edit advisory.</div>
                </div>
                <div class="p-4 rounded-2xl bg-slate-50 border border-slate-200 text-center">
                    <div class="text-xs font-bold text-orange-600 uppercase tracking-wider mb-1">Tier 2: Delisting</div>
                    <div class="text-xs text-slate-600">Immediate removal of fraudulent, unverified, or misleading event listing.</div>
                </div>
                <div class="p-4 rounded-2xl bg-slate-50 border border-slate-200 text-center">
                    <div class="text-xs font-bold text-rose-600 uppercase tracking-wider mb-1">Tier 3: Permanent Ban</div>
                    <div class="text-xs text-slate-600">Account termination and email/domain blacklisting for confirmed scam operations.</div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </section>
    </div>

    <!-- Contact & Feedback Box -->
    <div class="mt-12 p-6 rounded-3xl bg-slate-900 text-white flex flex-col sm:flex-row items-start sm:items-center justify-between gap-4">
        <div>
            <h4 class="font-extrabold text-base">Have questions about our Community Guidelines?</h4>
            <p class="text-xs text-slate-300 mt-0.5">Report a suspicious event or contact our team for assistance.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="flex gap-2">
            <a href="/events" class="px-5 py-2.5 rounded-xl bg-pink-600 hover:bg-pink-500 text-white font-bold text-xs transition-all">
                Browse Verified Events
            </a>
        </div>
    </div>
</div>

<%- include('../partials/footer') %>
